              </p>

              <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gar-text-muted/20 mb-6">
                <pre class="bg-gar-bg-primary p-4 overflow-x-auto"><code class="text-sm text-gar-text-primary font-mono">{`# Build with video support (default)
cargo build --release

# Build without video support
cargo build --release --no-default-features

# Supported codecs
# - H.264
# - VP9
# - VP8
# - AV1`}</code></pre>
              </div>

              <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gar-text-primary mb-3">Supported Containers</h4>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gar-text-secondary space-y-1">
                <li>MP4 (H.264 codec)</li>
                <li>WebM (VP9, VP8)</li>
                <li>MKV (Matroska)</li>
                <li>AVI</li>
              </ul>

              <div class="mt-4 p-4 rounded-lg bg-gar-bg-secondary/50 border border-gar-text-muted/20">
