              <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gar-text-muted/20 mb-6">
                <pre class="bg-gar-bg-primary p-4 overflow-x-auto"><code class="text-sm text-gar-text-primary font-mono">{`# Set wallpaper for specific monitor
garbg set-monitor DP-1 ~/bg1.png
garbg set-monitor HDMI-1 ~/bg2.png -m fit

# Query monitors
